                "description": "Fusion 24-T9 Half-Round Chiseled Knob with Ahwahnee Rose - The Half-Round Chiseled Knob with Ahwahnee Rose is available in antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. As part of Fusion's American Relic Collection, the 24-T9 knobset is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.\r\n",
